radius — function-level blast radius for agents

Usage:
  radius index [--root <dir>]
  radius impact [--base <ref>] [--root <dir>] [--top N] [--min-confidence x] [--stale-scip] [--boundary <file>]
  radius inspect [--base <ref>] [--json <file>] [--no-open]   # HTML viewer in .radius/impact.html

Output is JSON on stdout, designed for agent consumption.
